[h2]A note on AI[/h2]

I've been a developer for years and made mods long before coding agents existed, often at the expense of time with my family. I openly use Claude Code and Codex: every feature is still discussed, designed and planned, not blindly "vibe coded". AI is here to stay; I chose to adapt rather than resist. Thank you to everyone who stood up against the personal attacks.

